window.docContents[142].resolve({"/Fermat___s-Last-Theorem-for-exponent-37/Supporting-machinery-developed-in-the-project/#Kummer___s-Criterion-and-Regular-Primes-in-Lean--Fermat___s-Last-Theorem-for-exponent-37--Supporting-machinery-developed-in-the-project--Thaine___s-theorem-and-circular-units":{"contents":"Sinnott's and Washington's two conventions for the group of circular units of\n coincide. The identification underwrites the use of either\nconvention in downstream Thaine-style annihilation arguments.\n\nFor every prime  in the Chebotarev-positive density set\n,\nthe Thaine auxiliary construction produces an annihilator of the class group\n drawn from a circular unit at . Combined\nwith a finite-set exclusion, this gives existence of Thaine auxiliaries outside any\nfixed finite set of bad primes.\n\nThe set of Thaine auxiliary primes is infinite.\n\n","context":"Kummer's Criterion and Regular Primes in Lean\u0009Fermat's Last Theorem for exponent 37\u0009Supporting machinery developed in the project","header":"11.6.2. Thaine's theorem and circular units","id":"/Fermat___s-Last-Theorem-for-exponent-37/Supporting-machinery-developed-in-the-project/#Kummer___s-Criterion-and-Regular-Primes-in-Lean--Fermat___s-Last-Theorem-for-exponent-37--Supporting-machinery-developed-in-the-project--Thaine___s-theorem-and-circular-units"},"/The-final-proof-of-Kummer___s-criterion/The-final-theorem/#Kummer___s-Criterion-and-Regular-Primes-in-Lean--The-final-proof-of-Kummer___s-criterion--The-final-theorem":{"contents":"Kummer's criterion. Let  be an odd prime. Then\n\n\nTake  to be the standard cyclotomic field . By\ndefinition, regularity of  is coprimality with the class number of this standard\ncyclotomic field. Since  is prime, this is equivalent to\n. Applying\n to this  identifies divisibility by \nwith the existence of a Bernoulli numerator in Kummer's range divisible by .\nNegating  gives\nexactly the displayed universal non-divisibility condition.\n\n","context":"Kummer's Criterion and Regular Primes in Lean\u0009The final proof of Kummer's criterion","header":"8.4. The final theorem","id":"/The-final-proof-of-Kummer___s-criterion/The-final-theorem/#Kummer___s-Criterion-and-Regular-Primes-in-Lean--The-final-proof-of-Kummer___s-criterion--The-final-theorem"}});